    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a questionable decision, Coral gains the ability to talk to jellyfish. Isn't it just so convenient that there's seven of them in her class?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't see any romance, gruesome fights or deep conversations; but you will get a few accurate facts about jellyfish, light-hearted stories and hopefully 0.5-3 hours of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes: seven jellyfish, arts &amp; crafts, a bonus dress-up minigame, and maybe the option to die a couple of times. </p>",
